<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Low</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">SZA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">SOS</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2GAhgAjOhEmItWLfgisyOn</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.900" end="00:05.130">Tell 'em to shoot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.130" end="00:08.040">I'm out the loop, I'm outta the range</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.040" end="00:14.960">Oh, I stay out the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.960" end="00:17.900">Got another side of me, I like to get it popping</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.900" end="00:21.380">But these b- in my business got me out here choosing violence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.380" end="00:24.600">If you see me out in public, you don't know me, keep it silent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.600" end="00:27.990">In the bedroom I be screaming, but outside I keep it quiet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.990" end="00:30.760">Keep it on the lowski, I'm the lowest of the lowest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.760" end="00:34.540">Wanna see if you can keep it, let nobody know sh-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.540" end="00:38.090">I need you to get the f- off my space (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.090" end="00:41.390">Replacement's on the way, please don't play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.390" end="00:44.530">The p- feeling like a great escape (oh, oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.530" end="00:47.800">I need a new trick, old dogs don't change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.800" end="00:50.860">I'm f-, I ain't making love no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.860" end="00:54.090">You got a new b-, what the f- you crying for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.090" end="00:57.070">I'm moving selfish, calling all my favorite h-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.070" end="01:01.190">You know how to reach me every time and it plays in your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.190" end="01:04.440">With a rush that feels like we committing a crime</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.440" end="01:08.100">You know where you belong, I'm gon' save you a spot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.100" end="01:13.610">We can't be outside, 'cause the block is too hot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.610" end="01:17.090">And I'm all on your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.090" end="01:23.910">Wherever you are, don't call me (hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.910" end="01:27.620">Got another side of me, I like to get it popping (alright)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.620" end="01:30.800">But these b- in my business got me out here choosing violence (yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.800" end="01:34.130">If you see me out in public, you don't know me, keep it silent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.130" end="01:37.350">In the bedroom I be screaming, but outside I keep it quiet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.350" end="01:40.700">Keep it on the lowski, I'm the lowest of the lowest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.700" end="01:44.220">Wanna see if you can keep it, let nobody know sh-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.220" end="01:47.620">Keep it on the lowski, I'm the lowest of the lowest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.620" end="01:51.150">Wanna see if you can keep it, let nobody know sh- (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.150" end="01:54.320">I need total confidential, privacy (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.320" end="01:57.860">Don't want no one thinking I'm a groupie (it's lit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.860" end="02:01.200">Times zones change, now we on a first-class trip (straight up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.200" end="02:04.390">Don't work my nerves, you know I get moody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.390" end="02:07.050">We f-, we ain't making love no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.050" end="02:10.280">You talk that talk, but it don't match with yo' stroke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.280" end="02:13.400">Wherever you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.400" end="02:16.750">Whatever you need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.750" end="02:19.740">Don't call me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.740" end="02:24.240">Don't call me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.240" end="02:27.150">Got another side of me, I like to get it popping</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.150" end="02:30.340">But these b- in my business got me out here choosing violence (alright)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.340" end="02:33.780">If you see me out in public, you don't know me, keep it silent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.780" end="02:36.940">In the bedroom I be screaming, but outside I keep it quiet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.940" end="02:40.310">Keep it on the lowski, I'm the lowest of the lowest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.310" end="02:43.570">Wanna see if you can keep it, let nobody know sh-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.570" end="02:47.020">Keep it on the lowski, I'm the lowest of the lowest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.020" end="02:51.020">Wanna see if you can keep it, let nobody know sh- (let's-)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.020" end="02:53.040">F- you, real sh-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.040" end="02:54.860">I wasn't even on, f- you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.860" end="02:58.170">But you tryna make me look stupid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.170" end="02:59.670">I'll slap the dog sh- out of you, stop playing with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.780" end="03:02.780" /></div></body></tt>